"sku\": \"BL-HC-ASC18\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/ambientscreen-curved-18\", \"category\": \"home-cinema\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_ambientscreen-curved-18.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/ambientscreen-curved-18\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.8mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Ta14,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 ideal for home cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Its curved design with 2000R, 3000R, or 4000R curvature matches the eye's natural shape, enhancing immersion and reducing eye strain during long viewing sessions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the key technical specifications of this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 4K UHD resolution, 800 nits brightness, 178\\u00b0 viewing angle, and a high refresh rate of 3840Hz for smooth motion rendering.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the display size be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 is available in three sizes: 120\\\", 150\\\", and 180\\\", allowing you to choose a size that best fits your room and viewing preferences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this product compare to flat LED or OLED screens?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike flat screens, its curved design offers a wider field of view with more uniform picture quality and reduced peripheral distortion, providing a more engaging cinema experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this curved LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation requires a professional setup that accommodates curved configurations and mounting supports, ensuring structural stability and optimal viewing angles in your home cinema.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there a warranty or after-sales support included?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated after-sales support to ensure long-term performance and customer satisfaction.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 and can it handle ambient lighting?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 800 nits brightness, it performs well in moderate ambient lighting, maintaining vibrant images and good visibility even in open-plan living spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What types of rooms or environments are best suited for this display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is perfect for media rooms, game rooms, open-plan living areas, and entertainment lounges, where immersive, wraparound visual experiences elevate entertainment quality.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-s