\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T65b,<h1>AmbientScreen Curved 1.8</h1><p>Discover AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 for dynamic curved LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE to upgrade your display solutions!</p><p><strong>Curved LED for wraparound immersion in any room.</strong></p><p>Experience cinema-grade immersion with a gently curved LED display that wraps around your field of vision. The concave curvature matches the natural curvature of the human eye, reducing eye strain during long viewing sessions and creating a more immersive experience than flat screens. Ideal for open-plan living areas and game rooms. Available in 2000R, 3000R, and 4000R curvatures.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 ideal for home cinema?</h3><p>Its curved design with 2000R, 3000R, or 4000R curvature matches the eye's natural shape, enhancing immersion and reducing eye strain during long viewing sessions.</p><h3>What are the key technical specifications of this LED display?</h3><p>It features a 1.8mm pixel pitch, 4K UHD resolution, 800 nits brightness, 178° viewing angle, and a high refresh rate of 3840Hz for smooth motion rendering.</p><h3>Can the display size be customized for different room sizes?</h3><p>Yes, AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 is available in three sizes: 120&quot;, 150&quot;, and 180&quot;, allowing you to choose a size that best fits your room and viewing preferences.</p><h3>How does this product compare to flat LED or OLED screens?</h3><p>Unlike flat screens, its curved design offers a wider field of view with more uniform picture quality and reduced peripheral distortion, providing a more engaging cinema experience.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 - Innovative Curved LED Display UAE | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover AmbientScreen Curved 1.8 for dynamic curved LED displays in Dubai. Contact Brightluxx UAE to upgrade your display solutions!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/ambientscreen-curved-18\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3emid448q9z0e.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/36ljooz643x7p.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L1c\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey